\begin_inset Formula 
\[
x_{2}=\frac{p_{1}}{p_{2}}\frac{(1-\alpha)}{\alpha}x_{1}
\]

\end_inset

We plug this expression for 
\begin_inset Formula $x_{2}$
\end_inset

 into the budget constraint
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
w-p_{1}x_{1}-p_{2}\left(\frac{p_{2}}{p_{1}}\frac{(1-\alpha)}{\alpha}x_{1}\right)=0
\]

\end_inset

and solve for 
\begin_inset Formula $x_{1}$
\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula 
\[
x_{1}=\frac{\alpha w}{p_{1}}
\]

\end_inset

Finally, we obtain a function for 
\begin_inset Formula $x_{2}$
\end_inset


\begin_inset Formula 
\[
x_{2}=\frac{(1-\alpha)w}{p_{2}}
\]

\end_inset


